msgstr "Règles d'exonération"

#: includes/class-vat-guard-admin.php:409
msgid "Disable VAT Exemption"
msgstr "Désactiver l'exonération de TVA"

#: includes/class-vat-guard-admin.php:413
msgid "Skip VAT exemption entirely and just register VAT numbers"
msgstr ""
"Ignorer complètement l'exonération de TVA et enregistrer uniquement les "
"numéros de TVA"

#: includes/class-vat-guard-admin.php:415
msgid ""
"When enabled, VAT numbers will be collected and validated but no tax "
"exemption will be applied."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'activé, les numéros de TVA seront collectés et validés mais aucune "
"exonération fiscale ne sera appliquée."

#: includes/class-vat-guard-admin.php:421
msgid "Pricing Options"
msgstr "Options de Prix"

#: includes/class-vat-guard-admin.php:424
msgid "Fixed Prices Including VAT"
msgstr "Prix Fixes TTC"

#: includes/class-vat-guard-admin.php:428
msgid "Show the same prices including VAT regardless of customer location"
msgstr "Afficher les mêmes prix TTC quel que soit l'emplacement du client"

#: includes/class-vat-guard-admin.php:430
msgid ""
"When enabled, all customers will see the same prices including VAT, "
"regardless of their country. This prevents WooCommerce from adjusting prices "
"based on location."
msgstr ""
"Lorsqu'activé, tous les clients verront les mêmes prix TTC, quel que soit "
"leur pays. Cela empêche WooCommerce d'ajuster les prix en fonction de "
"l'emplacement."

